      "text": "[8:00p.m.] #ThirdMainlandBridge #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good in and out of the Third Mainland Bridge.\n\n- Adeniji all the way through Adekunle, Unilag Waterfront, Ilaje and the Iyana Oworo is all good likewise the return trip to the Island.\n\nRemember to keep it within regulated speed limits\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
